- merge the separate history tray/static row/debug labels into a single UI element
    - many of the frame ordering bugs were caused by only maintaining/updating the
      history tray in GROUP_ROSTER_UPDATE. rather than fix this oversight, this is
      a good time to get rid of some technical debt.
