          corners of the party frames.

    - the mapping of party1/party2/.. can change when a group roster update occurs.
      this means objects that store references to who cast them/who they were cast on
      should not use party1/2/.. IDs. to handle this, add a translation table for
      slot -> GUID to get unchanging unique IDs. this translation should be used for
      character data (like casters, talents, names, etc.) but NOT for things that are
      fundamentally party slot based (like the trackerUI elements).
