- better non-fixed duration support: generalize current FIXED, LTE, GTE
  system to a duration range (min, max) where the default FIXED idea
  is implemented as (duration-TOLERANCE, duration+TOLERANCE), LTE is min=0,
  GTE is max=Inf. some abilities surely have extensions that are short
  enough that this helps distinguish
- do absorbs cause UNIT_HEAL events? could help ID AMS, ret pal DP
    - yep, it fires. but not a heal. is UNIT_ABSORB_AMOUNT_CHANGED(slot)
- GoAK might not be cancellable? check. helps identify.
    - it isn't. right clicking and /cancelaura do not work
    - however filter=HELPFUL|CANCELABLE is the same for ardent defender and GOAK,
      despite AD being cancelable (right click and /cancelaura)
- consider LibCustomGlow for shine
