      then seeing that ability before it is available means the reset was used,
      so infer the reset ability. can track the CD of that.
        * would not be able to track the reset ability if it was used to reset
          something else. e.g., if prep was used while adrenaline rush was available,
          the prep usage would not be noticed. but that's fine.
